sentences.l:
In the airy then by chance region long-haired Apollo
from above the Ausonian lines and the city was viewing,
on a cloud sitting, and with these the victorious addresses Iulus:

this man to Dardanian Anchises
was armour-bearer before, and faithful at the threshold guard;
then as companion to Ascanius the father assigned him.

sentences.t:
Et primum Antiphaten, is enim se primus agebat,
Thebana de matre nothum Sarpedonis alti,
coniecto sternit iaculo;

sentences.l:
And first Antiphates, for he first was pressing forward,
from a Theban mother the bastard of lofty Sarpedon,
with a hurled lays low javelin;
